                                        "entry_id": "f4338c66-90a8-3eb7-a744-d0ae1862c803",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A graffiti artist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abfbc792-2958-4317-afd1-9c0f0eb80e1d",
                                                "sense_id": "e8f1f8b1-9d8e-38c5-af9d-ddde418b68d0",
                                                "text": "Writers were reunited with their crews, none having seen each other since back in the day, since they'd spun from teenage affiliations into lives more burdened and serious."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5172104f-3397-4c85-87d6-ba300536caeb",
                                                "sense_id": "e8f1f8b1-9d8e-38c5-af9d-ddde418b68d0",
                                                "text": "Two aspects of style co-exist in graffiti art, as explained in chapter 2. There is a writer's personal style, and there is iconic style, or style as convention."
